{"id":"663613","name":"苦瓜杭椒牛里脊肉","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/663613/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苦瓜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"牛里脊肉","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"杭椒","amount":"2根"},{"name":"生姜丝","amount":"少量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"苦瓜切掉两头，纵向切两半，去瓤、切厚片。","img":"images/663613/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"杭椒洗净，去蒂，切段。","img":"images/663613/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛里脊肉斜刀切厚片。","img":"images/663613/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"牛里脊肉片加入1匙盐、生粉，抓匀备用。","img":"images/663613/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"苦瓜沥水，生姜切丝。","img":"images/663613/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅热油，焙香姜丝和杭椒。","img":"images/663613/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入苦瓜片，加1匙盐，翻炒至变色。","img":"images/663613/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入牛里脊肉，少量清水，翻炒至肉熟。","img":"images/663613/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"关火装盘。","img":"images/663613/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}